1
00:00:00,447 --> 00:00:02,447
(Sheldon:)Is that what that was? I just assumed...

2
00:00:02,615 --> 00:00:05,115
...that the second-grade curriculum
had rendered you quizzical.

3
00:00:05,285 --> 00:00:07,205
[KNOCKING ON DOOR]

4
00:00:08,413 --> 00:00:12,753
(Penny(knocking and entering, holding up a pair of superman undershorts.):)Hey, Leonard, you left your underwear
in the drier downstairs.

5
00:00:14,878 --> 00:00:16,668
Pfft.

6
00:00:18,423 --> 00:00:19,803
(Leonard:)Those are not mine.

7
00:00:21,217 --> 00:00:24,767
Really? They have
your little name label in them.

8
00:00:25,513 --> 00:00:28,103
Oh, yeah, no, I use those...

9
00:00:28,266 --> 00:00:32,606
(Leonard:)...just to polish up
my spearfishing equipment.

10
00:00:33,938 --> 00:00:35,438
I spearfish.

11
00:00:39,110 --> 00:00:41,820
(Leonard:)When I'm not crossbow hunting,
I spearfish.

12
00:00:44,491 --> 00:00:47,951
(Leonard:)Penny, this is Sheldon's twin sister.
Missy, this is our neighbor Penny.

13
00:00:48,119 --> 00:00:50,159
(Leonard:)- Hi.
- Wow, you don't look that much alike.

14
00:00:50,330 --> 00:00:52,870
Can I get a hallelujah?

15
00:00:53,583 --> 00:00:55,583
(Sheldon:)Fraternal twins
come from two separate eggs.

16
00:00:55,752 --> 00:00:57,962
(Sheldon:)They are no more alike
than any other siblings.

17
00:00:58,129 --> 00:01:00,019
(Howard:)Hallelujah.

